---
// Differentiator Section — "Yang Kamu Dapat Bukan Hanya Sertifikat"
---

<section class="section-padding bg-slate-900 border-y border-slate-800 relative overflow-hidden" aria-label="Pembeda Utama Pitcar Academy">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-950/50 via-slate-900 to-slate-950/50 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="container-custom relative z-10">
    <div class="headline-container">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-600/10 text-brand-300 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-brand-600/20 mb-5">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
        Lebih Dari Sekadar Kursus
      </span>
      <h2 class="heading-primary text-white mb-5">
        Yang Kamu Dapat <span class="text-brand-300 italic">Bukan Hanya Sertifikat</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Kami merancang proses pembelajaran bertahap untuk membangun kompetensi teknis, karakter profesional, hingga pembukaan peluang karier di ekosistem bengkel nyata.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Transformation Flow Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 relative">

      <!-- Step 1: SKILL -->
      <div class="bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-brand-600/50 rounded-2xl p-7 flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-600/10 border border-brand-600/20 text-brand-400 font-black text-sm flex items-center justify-center">01</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 tracking-wider uppercase">Langkah 1</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-400 transition-colors">SKILL</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Belajar kompetensi teknis yang memang dibutuhkan mekanik di lingkungan bengkel modern secara terstruktur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="text-brand-500" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg>
          Kemampuan Teknis Lapangan
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2: EXPERIENCE -->
      <div class="bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-brand-600/50 rounded-2xl p-7 flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-600/10 border border-brand-600/20 text-brand-400 font-black text-sm flex items-center justify-center">02</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 tracking-wider uppercase">Langkah 2</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-400 transition-colors">EXPERIENCE</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Mengaplikasikan kemampuan melalui praktik intensif di kelas & 2 bulan OJT langsung di bengkel PITCAR.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="text-brand-500" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
          2 Bulan OJT Bengkel Nyata
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3: CHARACTER -->
      <div class="bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-brand-600/50 rounded-2xl p-7 flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-600/10 border border-brand-600/20 text-brand-400 font-black text-sm flex items-center justify-center">03</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 tracking-wider uppercase">Langkah 3</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-400 transition-colors">CHARACTER</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Membentuk disiplin, tanggung jawab, komunikasi customer, dan etos kerja profesional khas bengkel PITCAR.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="text-brand-500" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          Mental & Etos Kerja Profesional
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4: CAREER -->
      <div class="bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-brand-600/50 rounded-2xl p-7 flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-600/10 border border-brand-600/20 text-brand-400 font-black text-sm flex items-center justify-center">04</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 tracking-wider uppercase">Langkah 4</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-400 transition-colors">CAREER</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Membawa bekal kompetensi & pengalaman nyata untuk melangkah percaya diri ke dunia kerja industri otomotif.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="text-brand-500" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="7" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/></svg>
          Kesempatan Rekrutmen PITCAR
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
